# Chains checked 2026-10-18 with openssl s_client:
#   api.launcherhub.net            Let's Encrypt YE2 -> Root YE -> ISRG Root X2 -> ISRG Root X1
#   m5burner-cdn.m5stack.com       DigiCert Encryption Everywhere DV TLS CA - G2 -> DigiCert Global Root G2
#   github.com                     Sectigo DV E36 -> Sectigo Public Server Authentication Root E46 -> USERTrust ECC
#   objects / release-assets / raw.githubusercontent.com   Let's Encrypt YR1 -> Root YR -> ISRG Root X1
# The others are common roots for links users add (Google Trust Services, Amazon, GlobalSign, Sectigo RSA).

